WEBVTT

00:00:01.590 --> 00:00:04.430
Universal Century 0096.

00:00:04.470 --> 00:00:05.680
Banagher Links,

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:08.930
a student attending
the Anaheim Electronics Industrial College

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:10.760
at the colony Industrial 7,

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:14.180
has a fateful encounter with
a green-eyed girl falling from the sky.

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:17.930
Prevent it? Prevent what?

00:00:17.970 --> 00:00:19.090
War.

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:22.180
The girl, who calls herself Audrey,

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:26.680
visits Cardeas Vist,
the current head of the Vist Foundation,

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:28.930
to prevent the transfer of Laplace's Box.

00:00:28.970 --> 00:00:32.180
But negotiations for the handover
of the Box proceed regardless.

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:35.760
Just then, the Londo Bell unit
of the Earth Federation Forces

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:39.720
seizes control of the colony
to prevent the handover of the Box.

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:42.550
The negotiations break down amid the chaos.

00:00:42.590 --> 00:00:46.130
Cardeas, who is actually Banagher's father,

00:00:46.180 --> 00:00:50.470
entrusts him with the Unicorn Gundam,
the key to Laplace's Box.

00:00:51.590 --> 00:00:52.680
Father...

00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:55.050
I'm sorry, Mom.

00:00:56.180 --> 00:00:57.380
I must...

00:01:00.470 --> 00:01:01.510
...go!

00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:05.720
Banagher uses the Unicorn Gundam
to fend off the Sleeves mobile suit.

00:01:05.760 --> 00:01:11.680
After the skirmish, he is retrieved by the
Londo Bell warship the Nahel Argama.

00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:16.970
Here he is reunited with Audrey,
who also happens to be aboard the ship.

00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:22.590
Let's see... Let's test the performance
of your new Gundam.

00:01:22.630 --> 00:01:28.050
However, the Nahel Argama is attacked
by the Neo Zeon leader Full Frontal,

00:01:28.090 --> 00:01:30.840
who is pursuing the Unicorn Gundam.

00:01:30.880 --> 00:01:33.840
The Nahel Argama is overwhelmed
by the fighting strength of Frontal,

00:01:33.880 --> 00:01:37.760
who is said to be
the second coming of the Red Comet.

00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:42.380
Audrey, who has now been revealed to
be the Zeon princess Mineva Zabi,

00:01:42.430 --> 00:01:44.050
is taken hostage by the ship's crew.

00:01:44.090 --> 00:01:49.010
If we take down that red mobile suit, then
you won't need Audrey as a hostage, right?

00:01:49.050 --> 00:01:49.970
I'll do it!

00:01:50.010 --> 00:01:52.630
Banagher confronts Frontal,

00:01:52.680 --> 00:01:57.720
but is captured and taken to
the Neo Zeon resource satellite Palau.

00:01:57.760 --> 00:01:59.930
Here he meets with Frontal,

00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:02.430
and those there remind him that
he himself has taken the life of another,

00:02:02.470 --> 00:02:04.880
even though it was in a combat situation.

00:02:04.930 --> 00:02:08.470
And from the Sleeves pilot Marida Cruz,

00:02:08.510 --> 00:02:11.590
Banagher learns about the hopes and dreams
of the space colonists.

00:02:12.180 --> 00:02:14.970
Palau soon becomes a battlefield

00:02:15.010 --> 00:02:18.880
as an operation to rescue Banagher
and the Unicorn Gundam begins,

00:02:18.930 --> 00:02:21.760
and Banagher is forced to
face Marida in battle.

00:02:21.800 --> 00:02:25.300
Ple Twelve.
That is her name.

00:02:25.340 --> 00:02:27.550
The 12th prototype.

00:02:27.590 --> 00:02:29.630
Thanks to the resonance
between the two Newtypes,

00:02:29.680 --> 00:02:32.720
Banagher sees into Marida's heart.

00:02:32.760 --> 00:02:35.380
Special forces commander Daguza
tells Banagher to

00:02:35.430 --> 00:02:38.220
take the Unicorn Gundam,
the key to the Box,

00:02:38.260 --> 00:02:42.220
and go to the coordinates
shown by the La+ Program.

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:45.800
All you're doing now is running away
from the troubles in front of you.

00:02:45.840 --> 00:02:48.050
But people are going to die!

00:02:48.090 --> 00:02:50.800
What's this "responsibility" that
means I have to kill people?

00:02:50.840 --> 00:02:53.430
The coordinates shown by the La+ Program

00:02:53.470 --> 00:02:56.840
are the ruins of
the prime minister's residence,

00:02:56.880 --> 00:02:58.430
the space station Laplace.

00:02:58.470 --> 00:03:01.380
The station was destroyed
by a terrorist bombing

00:03:01.430 --> 00:03:04.630
in the middle of
the Universal Century charter announcement

00:03:04.680 --> 00:03:06.680
given by the first prime minister
Ricardo Marcenas,

00:03:06.720 --> 00:03:08.380
at the start of the new era.

00:03:08.430 --> 00:03:11.010
I never wanted to get in
this thing ever again.

00:03:11.050 --> 00:03:13.510
Not even if it meant
letting him down.

00:04:46.340 --> 00:04:47.380
(RETRIBUTION)

00:04:47.380 --> 00:04:50.670
(RETRIBUTION)
It's possible that the
La+ Program displays data

00:04:50.670 --> 00:04:53.090
when it recognizes
the suit's coordinates.

00:04:53.130 --> 00:04:57.550
The last time the NT-D activated,
it didn't display any new information.

00:04:58.340 --> 00:05:02.930
The station wreckage crosses those
coordinates every day at 0000 exactly.

00:05:03.430 --> 00:05:06.760
The prime minister's residence that was
destroyed by terrorists a long time ago.

00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:10.130
If the Box was hidden in
such an obvious place,

00:05:10.180 --> 00:05:13.550
wouldn't somebody have come
to check it out long ago?

00:05:13.590 --> 00:05:15.430
We don't know, which is why
we're checking it out.

00:05:15.470 --> 00:05:19.010
Focus on your piloting. We'll only
get one chance to make contact.

00:05:40.430 --> 00:05:44.380
Conroy, report in if there are any
changes, no matter how trivial.

00:05:44.430 --> 00:05:45.380
Roger.

00:05:45.430 --> 00:05:47.430
T-minus 2 minutes to arrival
at designated coordinates!

00:05:48.380 --> 00:05:50.880
To save this world
from the brink,

00:05:50.930 --> 00:05:53.800
a massive space settlement
plan was essential.

00:05:53.840 --> 00:05:59.760
And to carry it out, we needed an
arbiter that was on par with God.

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:01.760
And that was the
Federation Government?

00:06:01.800 --> 00:06:05.470
A merciless God that would ruthlessly
crush anyone who dared oppose it.

00:06:05.510 --> 00:06:07.720
The station sabotage
was the best thing

00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:10.470
that could have happened for
the Federation Government.

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:14.800
It kept its authority under the pretext
of terrorism prevention, you see.

00:06:15.510 --> 00:06:19.300
You make it sound like the Federation
staged the attack itself.

00:06:19.340 --> 00:06:22.970
In the grownup world, things
like that happen sometimes.

00:06:23.010 --> 00:06:26.510
There isn't anyone involved then
who is alive now.

00:06:26.550 --> 00:06:30.630
All that survives is the tradition
that commands us to fear the Box,

00:06:30.680 --> 00:06:33.720
and the symbiotic relationship
with the Vist Foundation,

00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:35.470
which has been preserved because of that.

00:06:35.510 --> 00:06:36.880
Tradition...

00:06:36.930 --> 00:06:39.380
It can't be changed by
one person acting alone,

00:06:39.430 --> 00:06:42.300
and no one even feels the slightest bit of
aspiration to change it.

00:06:42.340 --> 00:06:44.430
It happens with
any organization.

00:06:44.470 --> 00:06:47.130
But, you can't call the
cogs in the machine evil, either,

00:06:47.180 --> 00:06:51.590
not when they've only been swallowed by
the instinct to maintain the status quo.

00:06:51.630 --> 00:06:56.510
All the Box had to do
was stay put these hundred years.

00:06:57.510 --> 00:06:59.970
T-minus 15 seconds to arrival
at designated coordinates.

00:07:00.510 --> 00:07:01.470
12...

00:07:01.510 --> 00:07:02.430
11...

00:07:02.470 --> 00:07:03.470
10...

00:07:03.510 --> 00:07:04.430
9...

00:07:04.470 --> 00:07:05.380
8...

00:07:05.430 --> 00:07:06.340
7...

00:07:06.380 --> 00:07:07.300
6...

00:07:07.340 --> 00:07:08.340
5...

00:07:08.380 --> 00:07:09.340
4...

00:07:09.380 --> 00:07:10.300
3...

00:07:10.340 --> 00:07:11.260
2...

00:07:11.300 --> 00:07:12.340
1!

00:07:12.380 --> 00:07:15.840
Zero point has been achieved!
Crossing designated coordinates!

00:07:16.380 --> 00:07:19.430
Suit systems nominal.
How does it look?

00:07:19.470 --> 00:07:21.300
What?
Nothing's happening.

00:07:21.340 --> 00:07:22.470
Any changes on the outside?

00:07:22.510 --> 00:07:26.300
All green. No changes in either Unicorn
or Laplace Station wreckage.

00:07:34.090 --> 00:07:38.630
Greetings, citizens of Earth and space.

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:40.970
- Where's that coming from?
- What is this?

00:07:41.010 --> 00:07:43.970
Unknown! Can you pinpoint the
transmission origin from your end?

00:07:44.010 --> 00:07:48.680
Radio waves are emanating
from the RX-0. Please advise.

00:07:48.720 --> 00:07:51.010
- It's coming from here?!
- They're right, no doubt about it.

00:07:52.180 --> 00:07:55.800
I'd like to first express my sincere
gratitude for having the opportunity,

00:07:55.840 --> 00:07:59.470
on this momentous occasion, to address
all peoples across the Universe.

00:08:04.430 --> 00:08:06.760
The source of the signal
is the Unicorn?!

00:08:06.800 --> 00:08:10.130
Was the seal broken when it came
into contact with the wreckage?

00:08:10.180 --> 00:08:12.510
What's the status of the NT-D?

00:08:12.550 --> 00:08:14.880
I'm told that its activation
has not been observed.

00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:18.510
Orders, sir? Shall I delay our departure
so you can watch the investigation?

00:08:18.550 --> 00:08:20.550
Tell the Klimt that
our departure time

00:08:20.590 --> 00:08:23.800
might have to be changed
as circumstances warrant.

00:08:23.840 --> 00:08:26.510
Mas...ter...

00:08:26.550 --> 00:08:28.220
Minovsky particles?!

00:08:28.260 --> 00:08:30.470
Density is rapidly increasing.

00:08:30.510 --> 00:08:34.840
Unable to pinpoint source direction!
Dispersal pattern is not normalizing!

00:08:34.880 --> 00:08:38.550
Prepare for anti-air combat!
All hands, put on normal suits!

00:08:38.590 --> 00:08:42.050
There's a chance that the enemy
is mixed in with nearby civilian ships!

00:08:42.090 --> 00:08:44.130
Maintain strict anti-air surveillance!

00:08:44.180 --> 00:08:46.880
Even if that's the case, we're
inside Earth's Absolute Defense Zone.

00:08:46.930 --> 00:08:50.800
Camouflaged or no, it's unlikely that they
could have snuck in a fleet-scale force.

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:52.630
That's the problem!

00:08:52.680 --> 00:08:57.380
If they're using a small force, it means
they have a plan to put them to good use.

00:08:57.430 --> 00:09:00.970
...solutions for these problems,

00:09:01.010 --> 00:09:05.430
and each and every one of us must be
willing to change our way of thinking.

00:09:06.430 --> 00:09:10.510
To identify with humanity
as a species,

00:09:21.180 --> 00:09:22.180
Commander!

00:09:22.220 --> 00:09:23.220
Banagher!

00:09:23.260 --> 00:09:26.090
Something's coming.
The Nahel Argama is being targeted.

00:09:26.590 --> 00:09:27.970
Recall the investigation team!

00:09:28.010 --> 00:09:30.800
We should be able to use the ECOAS
Lotos as makeshift gun turrets, too.

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:32.720
Yes, sir!
What about the Unicorn?

00:09:32.760 --> 00:09:35.590
It's piping out some
crazy speech.

00:09:35.630 --> 00:09:37.930
Have it evacuate
before it becomes a target.

00:09:37.970 --> 00:09:41.010
Roger that.
Bridge to all mobile suits.

00:09:41.050 --> 00:09:44.380
Abandon current missions
and return to ship immediately!

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:47.090
What are you...

00:09:48.050 --> 00:09:50.470
- Here it comes!
- Can you tell how many?

00:09:50.510 --> 00:09:54.930
One. No, there's another formation
following behind it.

00:10:03.550 --> 00:10:07.380
The enemy squadron is pinned down
near the station wreckage.

00:10:07.430 --> 00:10:10.380
Good. Gilboa, when you feel it's
time to get out, you get out.

00:10:10.430 --> 00:10:11.470
Roger that.

00:10:11.510 --> 00:10:14.470
Watch yourself. That Gundam is
moving faster than we thought.

00:10:14.510 --> 00:10:17.880
It looks like it's the only suit
that left the wreckage.

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:20.220
The kid did seem
to have good intuition.

00:10:20.260 --> 00:10:22.300
This is bothering me, though.

00:10:22.340 --> 00:10:25.630
You don't think the speech
will play and that's it, do you?

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:28.220
The NT-D isn't active yet.

00:10:28.260 --> 00:10:30.680
There has to be something
yet to come that's still hidden.

00:10:30.720 --> 00:10:33.090
- Laser signal received!
- From the Rewloola?

00:10:33.130 --> 00:10:35.220
No, not from them.
It's- -

00:10:35.260 --> 00:10:38.010
Full Frontal...
Already here, eh?

00:10:44.550 --> 00:10:47.090
Use your beam magnum!
At this range, you can hit him!

00:10:47.130 --> 00:10:49.220
I can't.
It's too powerful.

00:10:49.260 --> 00:10:52.010
- Is this any time to be holding back?!
- I just need to close in!

00:11:02.180 --> 00:11:04.220
Do you think this
is a game, kid?!

00:11:04.260 --> 00:11:06.300
You take out an enemy
when you have the chance!

00:11:06.340 --> 00:11:11.380
If you let an enemy go, he might
kill an ally or even you!

00:11:11.430 --> 00:11:13.090
Who's playing around?!

00:11:13.130 --> 00:11:16.260
I take it seriously when my life
or someone else's is on the line,

00:11:16.300 --> 00:11:18.300
so I'm doing all I can,
all right?!

00:11:22.010 --> 00:11:23.260
Stay back, Banagher!

00:11:24.050 --> 00:11:25.050
Mr. Gilboa!

00:11:25.090 --> 00:11:29.130
We won't destroy the ship.
Our objective is to take back Marida.

00:11:29.180 --> 00:11:31.050
You're kidding...
But how?

00:11:31.090 --> 00:11:35.010
Look, just stay away. There's no
need for you to die here.

00:11:35.050 --> 00:11:37.180
Mr. Gilboa, wait!

00:11:37.220 --> 00:11:39.050
Take back the prisoner?

00:11:39.090 --> 00:11:42.010
RX-0 to Romeo 010, request relay.

00:11:42.050 --> 00:11:44.840
Enemy objective appears
to be retrieval of prisoner.

00:11:46.130 --> 00:11:48.760
- Reinforcements?
- The Red Comet...

00:11:53.880 --> 00:11:57.300
Leave the Mock Trojan Horse
to the Garencieres Team.

00:11:57.340 --> 00:12:01.180
As for us, we will attack the Unicorn
and trigger the NT-D.

00:12:01.220 --> 00:12:03.050
- Yes, sir!
- Don't hold back.

00:12:03.090 --> 00:12:05.840
You can't beat the Gundam unless
you fully intend to shoot it down.

00:12:05.880 --> 00:12:09.130
We guards will clear
a path for you, sir!

00:12:20.930 --> 00:12:25.260
He's toying with us! As if that
attitude will work on us now!

00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:27.590
Come on, let's see you
turn into a Gundam!

00:12:29.050 --> 00:12:30.760
Return fire!
Aim properly!

00:12:30.800 --> 00:12:32.180
I am!

00:12:36.180 --> 00:12:37.680
Isn't the investigation team
back yet?!

00:12:37.720 --> 00:12:41.090
There was a delay in reeling in
the Lotos. Five minutes to arrival!

00:12:42.630 --> 00:12:47.680
It's no use, postpone the shuttle
departure! We have to take shelter!

00:12:47.720 --> 00:12:49.930
The battle's already begun!
We have to get off this ship!

00:12:50.380 --> 00:12:51.800
Hey, the prisoner is awake!

00:13:22.850 --> 00:13:24.470
Fight like you mean it, Banagher!

00:13:24.510 --> 00:13:27.430
If you face off against him,
the NT-D should activate.

00:13:27.470 --> 00:13:29.810
If you keep this up,
they'll kill us by inches.

00:13:29.850 --> 00:13:32.470
B-But if I go all-out,
you'll be...

00:13:32.510 --> 00:13:35.720
The jump seat is fragile,
but I'm pretty tough.

00:13:35.760 --> 00:13:38.430
It'd be better to just
hand over the machine.

00:13:38.470 --> 00:13:41.060
What do you think will happen to the
Nahel Argama without the Unicorn?

00:13:42.510 --> 00:13:44.390
Those people are
combat pros.

00:13:44.430 --> 00:13:47.970
If they retrieve the prisoner, they won't
pass up a chance to take out an enemy.

00:13:48.010 --> 00:13:50.140
Your friends are on board
that ship, too.

00:13:50.180 --> 00:13:52.810
I know that!
Believe me, I know!

00:13:52.850 --> 00:13:54.640
I know that, but I still...

00:14:04.760 --> 00:14:05.810
Open the hatch.

00:14:08.140 --> 00:14:09.430
Hurry!

00:14:10.310 --> 00:14:13.810
- What are you doing?
- This will let you fight, won't it?

00:14:13.850 --> 00:14:17.470
No... You've got it all wrong.
That's not what the problem is! I...

00:14:17.510 --> 00:14:22.350
Banagher, I saw the NT-D
start to engage earlier.

00:14:22.390 --> 00:14:25.560
It looked as if it was reacting
to you personally.

00:14:25.600 --> 00:14:28.060
To your heart, which
sensed something

00:14:28.100 --> 00:14:30.350
as you were listening to the voice
of this ghost of Laplace.

00:14:30.390 --> 00:14:32.810
My heart?

00:14:32.850 --> 00:14:35.930
It's not a killing machine that was
designed to eradicate Zeon.

00:14:35.970 --> 00:14:40.100
Something else entirely is also
incorporated into the Unicorn.

00:14:40.140 --> 00:14:44.140
And that thing is probably controlled
by a human heart.

00:14:45.390 --> 00:14:48.560
That might be what the
La+ Program really is.

00:14:48.810 --> 00:14:52.390
A guidepost that tests the pilot's
heart as it leads him to the Box...

00:14:52.930 --> 00:14:56.220
Whoever built this thing
was one devious customer.

00:14:56.260 --> 00:14:57.970
What do you...

00:14:58.010 --> 00:14:59.470
There's no time.

00:14:59.510 --> 00:15:03.100
Once I go outside, you move
further in and wait for my signal.

00:15:03.140 --> 00:15:05.010
What are you planning?

00:15:05.060 --> 00:15:09.560
Even a cog in the machine has its pride.
You go fulfill your own role.

00:15:09.600 --> 00:15:10.930
My own...

00:15:12.970 --> 00:15:14.560
This knows what it is.

00:15:14.600 --> 00:15:18.060
It's the one part that lets you
decide for yourself who you are.

00:15:18.100 --> 00:15:19.510
Don't lose it.

00:15:22.260 --> 00:15:27.260
- It is now 23:59, Greenwich Mean Time.
- A responsibility I should carry out...

00:15:27.850 --> 00:15:29.350
It won't be long now.

00:15:44.850 --> 00:15:48.010
...and offer up a prayer.

00:15:48.850 --> 00:15:50.850
All that's left now
is the Unicorn.

00:15:50.890 --> 00:15:55.720
May the future of humans
in space be a peaceful one.

00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:58.430
It's not out of pride
or even to repay a debt.

00:15:58.470 --> 00:16:00.720
I listened to my heart,
that's all.

00:16:01.560 --> 00:16:04.100
I guess even cogs
have them.

00:16:04.140 --> 00:16:06.810
- Hopes.
- ...with faith in the god

00:16:06.850 --> 00:16:08.760
called Possibility.

00:16:16.390 --> 00:16:17.310
He's here!

00:16:17.350 --> 00:16:19.560
Your Vulcans!
Potshots are fine, just fire!

00:16:35.600 --> 00:16:37.010
Now!

00:16:40.760 --> 00:16:42.430
Banagher!

00:16:45.560 --> 00:16:47.470
Dagu...

00:16:47.510 --> 00:16:50.060
You're my hope.

00:16:50.100 --> 00:16:52.600
I entrust them all
to you, Banagher.

00:16:54.760 --> 00:16:56.390
You killed him!

00:17:17.180 --> 00:17:18.430
Captain!

00:17:21.600 --> 00:17:25.260
It turned into a Gundam!
Cuaron, do it just like we planned!

00:17:31.600 --> 00:17:33.350
In the end, he's just an amateur.

00:17:33.390 --> 00:17:36.140
He's behaving exactly like
the simulations predicted.

00:17:36.180 --> 00:17:38.140
We'll move in and flank him!

00:17:43.430 --> 00:17:46.260
Feel free to smash anything
but the cockpit! Do it!

00:17:56.560 --> 00:17:58.510
- We were lured in?!
- Angelo, run!

00:17:58.560 --> 00:18:00.560
He's no ordinary opponent.
Disengage!

00:18:04.560 --> 00:18:06.060
You damn monster!

00:18:21.140 --> 00:18:24.640
Captain! Please withdraw!
This isn't worth your life!

00:18:27.680 --> 00:18:31.810
Laser contact with Sinanju lost!
We can't pick it out from the debris!

00:18:31.850 --> 00:18:34.600
- And the Gundam?
- Psycho-monitor still online.

00:18:34.640 --> 00:18:36.680
If we track that, we can
get a lock on him.

00:18:36.720 --> 00:18:38.760
Alter heading and trajectory at once.

00:18:38.810 --> 00:18:41.850
We'll retrieve both suits before they're
pulled in by the gravity well.

00:18:41.890 --> 00:18:43.760
With me at the helm, sir?

00:18:43.810 --> 00:18:47.260
It's an atmospheric assist maneuver!
You'll manage, Flaste!

00:18:47.310 --> 00:18:49.350
Gilboa, time's up.

00:18:49.390 --> 00:18:52.680
You'll never be able to infiltrate the
Mock Trojan Horse in this situation.

00:18:52.720 --> 00:18:55.310
But, sir! If we
pass up this chance...

00:18:55.350 --> 00:18:59.850
Abort the operation. Gilboa Team,
redeploy to rescue Frontal Team.

00:19:11.180 --> 00:19:13.560
I'm gonna take you down
if nothing else!

00:19:14.720 --> 00:19:17.430
Banagher! If you can
hear me, stop this!

00:19:18.260 --> 00:19:21.260
If we keep this up, we'll both
burn up in the atmosphere!

00:19:34.600 --> 00:19:35.890
I won't miss this time!

00:19:41.890 --> 00:19:43.310
Banagher!

00:19:51.680 --> 00:19:55.680
Tikva...
Look after the family...

00:19:56.430 --> 00:19:58.310
Mr. Gilboa...

00:23:38.350 --> 00:23:41.560
Next time, on Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn

00:23:41.600 --> 00:23:44.010
FROM THE SCORCHING EARTH

00:23:45.140 --> 00:23:48.510
awaken the Newtype that lies within you.
